    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 21,
    "summary": "Limhi’s people are smitten and defeated by the Lamanites—Limhi’s people meet Ammon and are converted—They tell Ammon of the twenty-four Jaredite plates. About 122–121 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Limhi and his people returned to the city of Nephi, and began to dwell in the land again in peace.",
        "footNotes": [],
