        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king himself did not trust his person without the walls of the city, unless he took his guards with him, fearing that he might by some means fall into the hands of the Lamanites.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
