        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that there was no more disturbance between the Lamanites and the people of Limhi, even until the time that Ammon and his brethren came into the land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 127,
            "end": 132,
